# --- Generated code POLICY ---
# We DO commit build_runner output (*.g.dart, *.freezed.dart, *.gr.dart).
# Rationale: reproducible CI without a codegen step, reviewable diffs on entity
# changes, and it matches TASKS.md 0.2 ("*.g.dart kept"). Do NOT add ignore
# rules for those files.
